<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Camelot,Teck have 52.4 pct of Mt Edon.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Camelot,Teck have 52.4 pct of Mt Edon.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Camelot Resources NL and Teck Corp of Canada said on Friday they are entitled to 52.4 percent of Mt Edon Gold Mines (Australia) Ltd following their joint A$2.15 per share offer for the gold miner.</p>
<p>The Camelot-Teck offer valued Mount Edon at A$165 million.</p>
<p>Mt Edon recommended on February 11 that shareholders accept the offer for their shares after the bid was raised from A$2.15 per share.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
